<title>DUBAI: Saudi oil supply 8.0007 mln bpd in July.</title>
<headline>Saudi oil supply 8.0007 mln bpd in July.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia supplied 8.0007 million barrels per day (bpd) of crude to the market in July, 700 bpd above its OPEC supply quota of 8.00 million bpd, Gulf sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Production in the world's largest oil producer and exporter averaged 8.0003 million bpd in July.</p>
<p>OPEC ministers meeting in Vienna in June agreed to roll over the organisation's supply ceiling of 25.03 million bpd but called on major quota busters in the 11-member group to observe their agreed quotas.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
